1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,900
Your Saint Qiao High

3
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,300
wouldn't be starting a Yo-Yo School Team, would they?

4
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,190
Oh, please, I'm begging you.

5
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,180
Just let me have them.

6
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,580
Our Jianghai Team won't just battle anyone on a whim.

7
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:38,460
What a bunch of losers, acting all high and mighty.

8
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,860
Just messing around with you today.

9
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,750
It's just a little warning

10
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,220
for your Jianghai Team.

11
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:47,100
I gave him my Secret Yo-Yo Training Manual

12
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,540
to take a look at.

13
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:49,980
What?

14
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,990
Tony, do you know who their Coach is?
William!

15
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:55,560
How could he?

16
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:02,000
Episode 30

17
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,590
Matthew!

18
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,540
Matthew!

19
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,430
What's wrong with you?

20
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:27,420
I've been calling you and you didn't even react.

21
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,830
You called me? I didn't hear you.

22
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,820
Even during break,

23
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,740
you were over there mumbling and giggling to yourself.

24
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,180
What were you thinking about?

25
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:36,030
Did you win the lottery, or find some money?

26
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,470
No, nothing like that.

27
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,940
Well, I've got something to show you. Come with me.

28
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:40,860
No, I can't. I have something else. Another time.

29
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,200
What's wrong with you?

30
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,180
First you said it's nothing, then suddenly you're busy?

31
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,620
I really have something to do!

32
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:55,260
Were those two from the Chengnan Team?

33
00:02:55,420 --> 00:02:56,670
I looked into it.

34
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,590
There's a newly formed Saint Qiao Team.

35
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,580
They've already registered for the Tournament.

36
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,460
We should report this to Leo and the others right away.

37
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,870
No!

38
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,310
If I could tell them about it,

39
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,300
why would I come to you?

40
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:07,740
Why can't you tell them?

41
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,180
You really are dumb, you know that?

42
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,030
Admitting I lost to them... that's way too embarrassing.

43
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,420
But something this big... We can't just not report it.

44
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,340
Of course we have to report it.

45
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,740
But it won't be too late to tell them after we've won, right?

46
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,150
What are you getting at?

47
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,590
Isn't it obvious?

48
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,030
We go find them ourselves.

49
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:26,910
And when we do, you help me get some serious payback.

50
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:28,860
After we beat them, we'll report back.

51
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:31,710
We'll say we took down the Key Players of a hot new Team.

52
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,150
The Key Players of the Saint Qiao Team.

53
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:35,070
That way, we can report the situation

54
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,540
and save face at the same time.

55
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:39,420
Based on everything you just told me,

56
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,340
I don't think I can beat them either.

57
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,740
Well, you're the only one I can ask for help.

58
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,630
I thought about it a lot,

59
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:48,030
and you, Matthew, are the most loyal on the Team.

60
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,020
We get along best.

61
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,430
To be completely honest,

62
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,870
I wouldn't want to talk to anyone else

63
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:53,340
about something so personal.

64
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,260
Well, of course. You came to the right person.

65
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,340
Yesterday, after I bought the socks,

66
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,260
I ended up taking this exact route.

67
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:08,700
Saint Qiao school is over that way.

68
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,580
so they probably take this route a lot.

69
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:13,020
That's why I ran into them.

70
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:16,380
Why don't we just wait for them at the School Gate?

71
00:04:16,740 --> 00:04:18,300
It'll be easier to find them that way.

72
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:19,740
Let's go then.

73
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:24,540
Monica, I think we should go this way.

74
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,940
Why? Aren't we going to Saint Qiao School?

75
00:04:27,550 --> 00:04:30,750
Monica, it doesn't matter which route we take.

76
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,740
How can you say that?

77
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,180
That's going the opposite direction.

78
00:04:33,340 --> 00:04:35,100
Matthew!

79
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,980
Matthew! What a coincidence, running into you here!

80
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,260
If you can be here, why can't I?

81
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,630
What's so strange about that?
Monica!

82
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,100
Matthew!

83
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,500
Why are you acting like such a powder keg?

84
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:52,860
Is it because I beat your friend Teddy last time,

85
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,300
and you think I made you lose face?

86
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,740
No, no, no.

87
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,140
Can't you see I'm on my way to do something?

88
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,580
Don't pretend.

89
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,500
Let me buy you an ice cream to cool you down.

90
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,420
That'll calm your temper.

91
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,820
Stay right here and wait for me!

92
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:18,780
What now? She's got her eye on us.

93
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,700
More like she's got her eye on you!

94
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:24,260
I told you to run with me earlier, but you wouldn't listen.

95
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,460
How can you blame me?

96
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,830
You can't blame me either.

97
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:32,220
Matthew, here.

98
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,210
Monica, you eat it.

99
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,950
Hmph, you have it yourself.

100
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,900
She won't eat it. She's on a diet.

101
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,790
Who says I'm on a diet?

102
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,860
Women are basically always on a diet.

103
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,180
Then why aren't you on one?

104
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:48,540
I wont fall for your silly tricks,
and I don't care about it!

105
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,460
Well, I won't fall for your tricks either!

106
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:52,860
What "tricks"?

107
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,230
You know, one minute bringing someone mosquito repellent,

108
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,670
the next minute bringing them green bean soup,

109
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,140
the next minute buying them ice cream.

110
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:00,540
You're a strange person.

111
00:06:00,700 --> 00:06:02,460
Is what I do hurting you?

112
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:04,830
If you don't like seeing it, you can walk away.

113
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:06,300
Zoe, stop talking nonsense.

114
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:09,220
Why should I walk away? You should be the one to leave.

115
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,250
Monica, just drop it.

116
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:12,210
Why should I drop it?

117
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,950
I'm not scared of her!

118
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,420
I'm not scared of you either!

119
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:17,790
Don't think just because you beat Teddy last time,

120
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,260
you're suddenly all that.

121
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:20,190
Back at Falcon Camp,

122
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,660
you lost to me, remember?

123
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:25,500
Monica, I've been putting up with you for way too long.

124
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:28,530
I think someone as full of themselves as you,

125
00:06:28,540 --> 00:06:29,820
needs to be taught a lesson.

126
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:32,220
Fine. I'll take you on gladly.

127
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,570
How do you wanna do this? Name it.

128
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,540
Monica, there's a bigger enemy right now.

129
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,910
Don't waste time here.

130
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,860
No. Today, I'm seeing this through to the end.

131
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:44,700
Heh, what a pair of bickering chickens.

132
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,060
It's them!

133
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,900
Looks like you couldn't beat us,
so you went and got reinforcements.

134
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:54,780
Such a great reinforcement.

135
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,620
Who are you trying to scare?

136
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,020
This here might be the Jianghai Team's

137
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,940
most powerful top-tier Player, right?

138
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:04,860
Not top-tier...

139
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:09,180
But to deal with you two, I think I'm more than enough.

140
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:12,060
Don't think a big mouth makes you a hero.

141
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:16,860
A Hero needs real skills.

142
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:20,220
Fine. I'd like to see your real skills too.

143
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:23,100
Matthew, don't let your emotions get the better of you.

144
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,990
They've already beaten our Team's

145
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,460
Jacky and Hugo.

146
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:30,300
What, you need a woman to protect you now?

147
00:07:31,420 --> 00:07:33,190
I think she's your female bodyguard.

148
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,270
I think you two are like chatterboxes,

149
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:38,460
going on and on.

150
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:39,900
Enough talking. Let's go.

151
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,180
Meteor Firewall!

152
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,740
Wild Wolf Frenzy!

153
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:40,380
So that's the real strength of the Jianghai Team?

154
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:42,780
Let's go.

155
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Wait!

156
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,880
You haven't faced me!

157
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:01,980
Haven't you Chengnan guys lost enough times already?

158
00:11:02,620 --> 00:11:04,860
And you still dare to come out here flapping your gums?

159
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,260
I heard the Saint Qiao Team

160
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:09,180
has some loud-mouthed Cat

161
00:11:09,540 --> 00:11:11,100
so I came to see for myself.

162
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:13,020
You're the one who's a screeching wildcat!

163
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,380
Forget it, I won't even say it.

164
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:19,260
I don't want to hurt your pride.

165
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:23,100
Fine, then let's let our Skills do the talking.

166
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:31,740
Sky Fiend Shooting Star!

167
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,140
Silver Snake Assault!

168
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:50,940
Now will you shut up?

169
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,380
Why should I shut up?

170
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,300
Winning and losing is all part of the game.

171
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:55,740
Don't be so stubborn.

172
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:59,100
Joining two Loser teams together

173
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:01,500
just makes one bigger Loser Team.

174
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:05,340
Whether it's Jianghai or Chengnan,

175
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:09,660
Neither of you has a chance at the Championship.

176
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:13,020
The Title will definitely belong to our Saint Qiao Team.

177
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:16,860
Let's go.

178
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:22,620
Hmph, I don't believe that for a second.

179
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:25,500
Don't look so glum. We'll have another match next time.

180
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:26,940
Right now, the priority is

181
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,860
for our two teams to discuss a plan together.

182
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:32,220
I see that the Saint Qiao Team not only has Signature Moves,

183
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,620
but they're also hostile and full of malice.

184
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:36,690
Let's go.

185
00:13:36,700 --> 00:13:38,940
We don't need to Team up with the Chengnan Team.

186
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,860
That's a terrible thing to say.

187
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,260
What do you mean "Team up with us"?

188
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,150
We had something to do in the first place.

189
00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:46,620
Why do you keep following us?

190
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:49,500
Hmph, No good deed goes unpunished.

191
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,900
Matthew, take care of yourself.

192
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:55,710
You know what.

193
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,700
No matter what anyone says,

194
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,620
she did step in and help us with that Match.

195
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,060
Don't be like that to her.

196
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,500
What did I do to her?

197
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,860
Anyway, watch what you say from now on.

198
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,750
Don't be so harsh.

199
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:09,180
Well, she was mean too, so why aren't you lecturing her?

200
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,100
Hmph, I'm leaving.

201
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:15,420
But we still have things to discuss.

202
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:19,740
She's so moody.

203
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,110
When you throw the Yo-Yo down,

204
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,580
keep it on a vertical plane.

205
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,980
Then pull upward.

206
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,420
Maintain that vertical plane.

207
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,820
Like this?

208
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,180
Then I'll try again.

209
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,300
Yes! That's great, sis!

210
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,700
You did it almost perfectly.

211
00:14:57,640 --> 00:15:00,540
It's still far from meeting my standards.

212
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:03,900
Shawn, what brilliant insight do you have now?

213
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,580
Didn't any of you feel it?

214
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:14,460
Her movement may look perfect on the surface,

215
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:17,820
but it fundamentally lacks Inner Strength.

216
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:19,260
Oh, give me a break.

217
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:21,660
You're always rambling on about this energy or that energy.

218
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,580
And now you're bringing up 'Inner Strength'.

219
00:15:24,040 --> 00:15:25,470
What exactly is Inner Strength?

220
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,910
Is it something you can see or touch?

221
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:28,380
Anything that reaches a higher state

222
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:32,220
can only be felt, not explained.

223
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:35,580
Like a person's Aura,

224
00:15:36,220 --> 00:15:38,460
the flow of a good essay,

225
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:44,220
or the spirit captured in a fine painting.

226
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,580
Not to mention the elegance in calligraphy.

227
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:49,980
If you keep talking,

228
00:15:50,140 --> 00:15:51,900
I really am going to pass out from annoyance.

229
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:55,740
Fine, then let me get straight to the point.

230
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:58,140
Mini's Yo-Yo lacks Inner Strength

231
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,060
because she lacks confidence.

232
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,460
Although there are no obvious flaws on the surface,

233
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:05,310
throwing a Yo-Yo without Inner Strength

234
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,750
only results in accidental success.

235
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,220
It's very unstable.

236
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:10,620
Especially when it comes to crucial moments,

237
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:13,500
you'll be much more prone to making mistakes.

238
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,380
When you're criticizing others,

239
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:17,340
you sure have plenty of Inner Strength!

240
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:20,220
Why don't you try it out yourself?

241
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,620
Thank you for the compliment!

242
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:25,470
Speaking with Inner Strength just proves that

243
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:29,820
I've fully mastered all the theoretical knowledge.

244
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:34,140
This means I'll soon establish my own unique style

245
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:39,900
and become a famous critic in the Yo-Yo world!

246
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:44,700
Yeah, yeah, right. You're a critic.

247
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,620
A critic whose skills are critically average.

248
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,460
Mickey, that's enough.

249
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:53,820
Shawn does have a point.

250
00:16:58,580 --> 00:16:59,580
Leo!

251
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:03,420
Look, isn't that Matthew?

252
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:29,340
Hey Mom, I'm not going shopping for clothes.

253
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:33,180
What? A huge sale? That's great!

254
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:38,460
But the School Team really has a situation.

255
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:43,880
I really shouldn't go.

256
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:47,600
Alright, alright, you go ahead and shop by yourself.

257
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:50,940
Bye.

258
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:05,340
It seems that besides the Chengnan Team,

259
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:07,740
we have a much bigger rival to worry about.

260
00:18:08,180 --> 00:18:09,660
The Saint Qiao Team.

261
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:12,030
When did Saint Qiao High School

262
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:13,500
start a Yo-Yo Team?

263
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,820
Shawn, you have a new mission.

264
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:19,260
Starting tomorrow,

265
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,660
put all your effort into investigating the Saint Qiao Team.

266
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,550
Find out everything about them as soon as possible.

267
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:24,540
No problem.

268
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:28,380
Matthew, you reported the situation very promptly.

269
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:30,780
We need to gather the Team for a meeting ASAP

270
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:32,220
to discuss our counter-strategy.

271
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:36,060
Especially to remind them not to accept Challenges on their own

272
00:18:36,520 --> 00:18:37,980
and expose their Signature Moves too early.

273
00:18:39,410 --> 00:18:39,890
Captain.

274
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:42,780
Good thing my Signature Move isn't perfected yet.

275
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:45,180
So I couldn't use it at all.

276
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:46,620
Good.

277
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:48,060
Currently,

278
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:49,980
they only challenged Matthew to a Match.

279
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:53,590
The rest of our Team hasn't reported

280
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:54,780
any encounters yet.

281
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:55,740
Captain.

282
00:18:57,920 --> 00:19:00,540
Captain, I lost to them too.

283
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:05,310
After two days of extensive searching and investigating,

284
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:07,740
I've basically uncovered the Saint Qiao Team's situation.

285
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,180
Please take a look.

286
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:11,580
This is one of the Saint Qiao Team's

287
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:14,940
Mysterious Experts: Cold Cat.

288
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:16,860
And this is her partner in crime,

289
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:21,180
another Mysterious Expert: Gordon, also known as Hot Dog.

290
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:25,020
Recently, our Team's Monica and Matthew,

291
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:28,380
along with the Chengnan Team's Hugo, Zoe, and Jacky,

292
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:30,780
were all challenged by them one after another.

293
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:34,140
And they all lost to them.

294
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:37,980
From the feedback Monica and Matthew gave me,

295
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:42,300
and my own intelligence, I can see that

296
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:46,140
these two Experts are cold and ruthless,
with all sorts of bizarre tricks.

297
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:50,460
Their skills are supernatural, and they show no mercy.

298
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:53,820
They are certainly not to be underestimated.

299
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:56,700
They are definitely not ordinary.

300
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:59,580
How did such Experts appear so suddenly?

301
00:20:00,040 --> 00:20:03,420
Sis, we were completely caught off guard.

302
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:06,780
We originally thought our only Opponent

303
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:08,220
was the Chengnan Team.

304
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,590
There's another Top Expert,

305
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,990
All we know is he suddenly transferred back from the US.

306
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,940
Codename: Virus.

307
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,340
Wow.

308
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:20,700
Good thing we didn't run into him.

309
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:23,100
We don't even know where their people come from.

310
00:20:23,290 --> 00:20:24,540
Captain.

311
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,390
This guy also came back from the US.

312
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:58,620
Attention!

313
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:01,980
Count off!

314
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:06,300
1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9!

315
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:08,700
At ease.

316
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,100
Attention!

317
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:16,020
My Soldiers...

318
00:21:16,060 --> 00:21:17,340
The Competition is imminent.

319
00:21:18,500 --> 00:21:19,740
I announce

320
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:23,100
that the Jianghai Team is officially in Combat Mode!

